&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve numbered them for easier referencing in the Q&amp;amp;A.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="basic-exercises"&gt;Basic Exercises&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1 id="fe_1-count-0s-in-an-array"&gt;FE_1: Count 0s in an array&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write a method that takes an integer array as parameter and returns the number of 0 contained in it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="fe_2-count-occurrences-of-an-character-in-a-string"&gt;FE_2: Count occurrences of an character in a String&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write a method that takes a String s and a character c as parameters and returns
